Drop fruit into the jar.
Merge identical fruit on contact.
Create larger and more valuable fruit.
Increase your multiplier through successful merges.
Cash out to secure your multiplier.
Avoid overflowing the jar.

If the jar overflows before cashing out, the current round's multiplier is lost.

