Why is this interesting?

Fruit Fusion combines familiar and highly accessible merge gameplay with meaningful economic decisions. Players must constantly evaluate whether to secure their gains or continue building larger multipliers for potentially greater rewards.

The project demonstrates how Rare Friends can function as a player identity layer within casual games, while providing a foundation for future progression, achievements and ecosystem-wide engagement.

